    "Pane was closed at start; tabs_create refused, so the first navigate (robots.txt) opened the pane's seed tab. get_page_text on that seed tab returned https://www.amazon.com/robots.txt, apparently another concurrent operator's page; nothing else was done in it, and the operator then created its own tab (tab-2) and redid robots.txt there. Navigation 1 / action 1 is that seed-tab call.",
