    "Shipping (not store pickup) was chosen by click on the product page before each add; the cart shows a site-chosen ZIP for shipping, never changed.",
    "Post-add dialog offered a protection plan; it was not selected. After removal the header badge was stale (showed 2 items) until reload; empty-cart was exported after a reload showing 0 items.",
